<td style="vertical-align:top"><a href="d852858dex104.htm">Amended and Restated Employment Agreement, dated as of June&#160;20, 2024, by and between Tectonic Therapeutic, Inc. and Alise Reicin, M.D. </a></td></tr>
<tr style="font-size:1pt">
<td style="height:6pt"/>
<td style="height:6pt" colspan="2"/></tr>
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid ; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">
